sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Runtime (CLI/iOS/macOS)
    participant Core as SproutCore
    participant Disc as Discovery Service
    participant Resolver as Resolver

    App->>Core: bootstrap join (domain, purpose, goal, interests, requested porthole kind)
    Core->>Core: Acquire identity
    Core->>Core: Require explicit purpose/goal/interests
    Core->>Disc: POST /v1/bridges/query (explicit purpose+interests)
    Disc-->>Core: Signed BridgeDescriptors
    Core->>Core: Validate descriptor signature/domain/purpose/expiry
    Core->>Core: Derive explicit ScaffoldAdminIdentity from selected descriptor
    Core->>Resolver: registerStarterAuth(payload)
    Resolver-->>Core: accepted/denied
    Core->>Resolver: resolveEntity(identity, evidence, purpose, goal, interests)
    Resolver-->>Core: resolved(entity_id) or unresolved(reason)
    Core->>Resolver: requestCapabilities + membershipChecks
    Resolver-->>Core: grants + membership decision
    Core->>Resolver: issuePortholeAccessContract(resolved entity, bridge, client kind)
    Resolver-->>Core: signed PortholeAccessContract or deny
    Core->>App: Done or Error
